              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cltncook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fabulous! Used a sweet apple because that's what I had; didn't peel. Added one chopped peach from a can that I needed to use and about a dozen halved grapes I also needed to use. Didn't have any whipping cream so used 3/4 c. vanilla yogurt and upped the marshmallows to 1/2 c. Wonderful recipe. A keeper.",
