            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AuntE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made exactly as is but used stevia instead of sugar. Loved the crunch and the slight sweetness. I used my homemade mayo (whole egg Mayo here on AR)and to me it tastes so fresh doing that. I would def. consider using raisins, or cranberries if I didn't have dates. Even a touch of pineapple would be super.",
